        <h1 class="lp-hero-headline">
          From Data Engineering to
          <span class="highlight">Generative AI</span>—We've Got the Experts.
        </h1>

        <p class="lp-hero-sub">
          People Prime Worldwide provides specialized AI expertise across Data Engineering, Machine Learning,
          Generative AI, and MLOps to help organizations accelerate AI execution.
        </p>

        <!-- Key Benefits beside the form with original full copy -->
        <ul class="lp-hero-bullets">
          <li class="lp-hero-bullet-item">
            <div class="lp-hero-bullet-check">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><polyline points="2,8 6,12 14,4"/></svg>
            </div>
