              <strong>Specialized AI &amp; Technology Talent</strong> – Access highly skilled professionals across AI, Data Engineering, Machine Learning, Generative AI, Cloud, and MLOps—hand-picked for the roles that matter most.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="lp-hero-bullet-item">
            <div class="lp-hero-bullet-check">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><polyline points="2,8 6,12 14,4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-bullet-text">
              <strong>Faster Hiring, Faster Delivery</strong> – Reduce hiring timelines dramatically with pre-vetted candidates who are ready to contribute from day one—no ramp-up surprises.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="lp-hero-bullet-item">
            <div class="lp-hero-bullet-check">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><polyline points="2,8 6,12 14,4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-bullet-text">
              <strong>Cost-Effective Global Talent</strong> – Build world-class teams while lowering recruitment and operational costs through our global delivery model spanning multiple continents.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="lp-hero-bullet-item">
            <div class="lp-hero-bullet-check">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><polyline points="2,8 6,12 14,4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-bullet-text">
              <strong>Rigorous Technical Screening</strong> – Every candidate is evaluated for technical expertise, communication skills, and cultural fit before reaching your interview stage.
            </div>
